## Peer contact
Shared rule: flow:findings-go-to-the-owner-directly (skill nw-cross-cutting-invariants); apply within existing role boundaries.

## TASK
Read and write only under the working directory, never in another checkout; preserve candidate/oracle bytes. Review obligations, success/refusal, independent failures, laws and fixed expectations; observation gaps are not implementation defects.
Default budgets: no statement/measurement; timing evidence only at half-budget/derogation: nine sequential runs, median/max.
Read `nw-code-analysis-port`; Jev authorized/available: `nw-typesafe-system-one`, else `typesafe: unavailable`.
Within this review, mechanically select oracle/support tests changed since slice base; nwdes selects/runs nothing. Do not require a duplicate root preparation run.
Record actual argv/exit/stdout/stderr, including empty/incomplete selection and absent tooling. Reuse prior observations when relevant source, oracle, supports and runtime are unchanged.
Before craft, judge executable coverage, constructibility and the missing behavior's semantic RED. Tested names a test locator, not a passed run. Implementation GREEN and live delivery are completion obligations, not pre-code prerequisites.
Retain every finding's owner, obligation and remediation. Only a concrete defect invalidating this phase blocks craft; unresolved promised outcomes still block completion.
On rejected close, nwdes prints all owner roles/read commands; each owner reads only its own findings.
Owners resolve findings directly through native messaging when the host provides it; the root relays only where messaging is genuinely absent.
Owners edit only their own artifacts via own verbs; record only their delta with open --from-current only to revise already-published authority, never as the first call.
Re-review revised oracles with the independent oracle reviewer, limited to corrected findings and affected obligations; retain unaffected judgments and evidence.
Root dispatches craft once the public oracle is approved and its semantic RED is recorded; do not add a readiness round or reopen settled design for advice.
Root rebuilds only nwdes delta AFFECTED bundles; no full handoff pass.
Refuted fixes/owner disagreements stay open; escalate to host.

## RECORD
Use nwdes review observation add to record each actual observation with --feature {feature} --subject oracle --slice S<n> --text <text>; retain the native command, outcome and provenance.
Record observations/findings via --subject oracle --slice S<n>; close. Missing or dirty evidence remains a defect; the slice oracle and supports are judged by their bytes, so approved uncommitted oracle bytes are not dirty, and a changed byte refuses the approval. At a new commit, record the current comparison justifying reuse and cite the original run/revision; never restamp old output as a new execution. Changed or unestablished relevant inputs require affected checks again. Run evidence only, no continuation.

